{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>And he shall slaughter.</b> Singular form, for such is the manner of slaughter; but for the offering it is written in the plural: והקריבו, וזרקו, וערכו, ונתנו." "<b>The bull.</b> This implies a choice young animal, that one should not bring an old or sick one, because of ״הקריבהו נא לפחתך.״" "<b>The sons of Aaron.</b> That elderly priests should not perform the offering, for their hands tremble; and so they said in tractate חולין: from when are priests disqualified? From when their hands tremble."], :book :leviticus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:07:46.662053631Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}